WEBVTT

00:00.270 --> 00:07.150
The new morning we've finally found

00:00.270 --> 00:07.150
Yatto mitsuketa atarashii asa wa

00:07.150 --> 00:11.190
is being hampered by the past.

00:07.150 --> 00:11.190
Tsukihi ga jama wo suru

00:11.390 --> 00:16.660
What we chased after wasn't the future,

00:11.390 --> 00:16.660
Mukau saki wa tsugi ja nakute

00:16.660 --> 00:20.490
but the past so full of remorse.

00:16.660 --> 00:20.490
Sugi bakari oikaketa

00:21.870 --> 00:26.960
The ruthless memories won't stop playing;

00:21.870 --> 00:26.960
Nariyamanai yousha nai omoide tachi wa

00:26.960 --> 00:31.050
they won't be forgiving us for a long time.

00:26.960 --> 00:31.050
Yurushite kuresou nimonai

00:32.340 --> 00:36.890
It's about now that a teardrop

00:32.340 --> 00:36.890
Sorosoro kana tesaguri tsukareta hoho wo

00:36.890 --> 00:41.560
beings to roll down my fatigued cheeks.

00:36.890 --> 00:41.560
Kattou ga koboreochiru

00:41.890 --> 00:46.810
Will this rain ever stop?

00:41.890 --> 00:46.810
Ame wa itsuka yamunodeshouka

00:46.810 --> 00:52.030
I've been freezing for a long time.

00:46.810 --> 00:52.030
Zuibun nagai aida tsumetai

00:52.030 --> 00:57.320
Why does the rain continue to fix on me?

00:52.030 --> 00:57.320
Ame wa doushite boku wo erabuno

00:57.320 --> 01:02.080
I wonder if it could embrace me.

00:57.320 --> 01:02.080
Tsutsumarete iikana

01:02.080 --> 01:06.870
Today, the rain falls again;

01:02.080 --> 01:06.870
Ame wa yamu koto wo shirazuni

01:06.870 --> 01:12.090
endlessly it falls knowing no end.

01:06.870 --> 01:12.090
Kyou mo furitsuzukukeredo

01:12.090 --> 01:17.130
We nestle close to each other to share the warmth

01:12.090 --> 01:17.130
Sotto sashidashita kasa no naka de

01:17.680 --> 01:28.850
under this umbrella, you gently held out to me.

01:17.680 --> 01:28.850
Nukumori ni yorisoinagara

01:39.240 --> 01:40.320
Bastard!

01:59.390 --> 02:02.180
That's as far as you're going to get.

02:02.200 --> 02:05.200
A Fierce Counterattack

02:02.200 --> 02:05.200
A Fierce Counterattack

02:10.940 --> 02:12.320
Dad!

02:12.320 --> 02:16.440
He was trying to make philosopher's stones again.

02:16.860 --> 02:19.700
Humans should just stay as stones.

02:22.200 --> 02:25.450
Why do you treat humans like such lowly creatures?

02:26.160 --> 02:28.830
Philosopher's stones can be created from humans,

02:28.830 --> 02:31.540
and homunculi can be created from philosopher's stones.

02:31.540 --> 02:34.300
So, answer me. What can be created from homunculi?

02:34.300 --> 02:35.840
What do you give birth to?!

02:36.300 --> 02:39.970
An existence that only brings about destruction can be called 'God'?

02:40.380 --> 02:43.050
You may believe that you've become a perfect being,

02:43.390 --> 02:45.890
but all you are is an obstacle in the cycle of life!

02:47.680 --> 02:49.100
Is that so?

02:49.100 --> 02:50.980
Then I shall give birth to humans.

03:17.420 --> 03:19.840
I've obtained immortality....

03:20.510 --> 03:23.930
I'm still alive...

03:24.800 --> 03:26.930
King Xerxes!

03:41.240 --> 03:42.200
A body!

03:42.200 --> 03:43.490
This body is mine!

03:43.490 --> 03:44.780
Finally, a body...

03:44.780 --> 03:45.620
Stop...

03:45.620 --> 03:46.490
Please, stop...

03:46.950 --> 03:49.540
This... This isn't right!

03:50.660 --> 03:52.790
Look! A body!

03:52.790 --> 03:54.080
Hohenheim...

03:54.540 --> 03:55.960
Guys...

03:57.550 --> 04:00.510
You!!

04:09.890 --> 04:10.770
Shoot!

04:16.980 --> 04:18.860
What the hell is going on?!

04:22.530 --> 04:23.820
Shit!

04:23.820 --> 04:24.740
Greed!

04:25.240 --> 04:26.490
D.K.!

04:26.490 --> 04:27.240
Looks like you're okay.

04:27.580 --> 04:30.200
Great timing! Give me a ride.

04:30.200 --> 04:32.370
It'll probably help to have someone with you who knows what's up.

04:32.370 --> 04:35.330
Yeah! What on earth is going on?!

04:35.330 --> 04:39.000
The leader of the homunculi, "Father," is off on a rampage.

04:39.000 --> 04:42.170
Those who can't fight should get off right here!

04:43.130 --> 04:44.010
Hey!

04:44.010 --> 04:45.970
The frog and the two princesses!

04:45.970 --> 04:46.800
Scram!

04:46.800 --> 04:48.220
You're all injured!

04:48.760 --> 04:50.100
Don't be ridiculous!

04:50.100 --> 04:52.140
Who else but me will take the lead?!

04:52.350 --> 04:53.600
Hell if I know!

04:53.600 --> 04:54.980
Just get the hell off of there!

04:54.980 --> 04:57.350
This ain't the time to be blabbering on about leading!

04:57.560 --> 04:58.860
You have no right to-

04:58.860 --> 04:59.650
General!

05:00.940 --> 05:02.440
A call from headquarters.

05:03.530 --> 05:05.700
Mission headquarters? It's me.

05:05.700 --> 05:07.070
What's the status over there?

05:07.910 --> 05:10.740
Ma'am, half of Central Headquarters...

05:11.990 --> 05:13.750
...has been annihilated.

05:14.910 --> 05:16.210
What?

05:16.210 --> 05:18.290
We can't get in touch with the North Gate.

05:20.710 --> 05:22.630
That's what he's capable of.

05:24.970 --> 05:26.840
Just what is he...?

05:26.840 --> 05:28.930
He looks like an ordinary human from the outside.

05:29.430 --> 05:34.310
However, he has several hundred thousand human souls worth of philosopher's stones stored in his body,

05:34.310 --> 05:37.810
and has absorbed God with that energy.

05:39.150 --> 05:42.150
You alchemists out there should understand the severity of the situation.

05:42.860 --> 05:44.320
Philosopher's stones...

05:44.650 --> 05:47.070
You ordinary humans should stay behind.

05:48.160 --> 05:52.120
My men are up there fighting.

05:52.120 --> 05:54.830
I am their commander.

05:57.670 --> 06:00.790
General, headquarters would like to speak with you.

06:03.130 --> 06:04.260
What is it?

06:04.260 --> 06:05.590
Don't worry, General.

06:06.130 --> 06:13.720
Don't forget that we Briggs soldiers are capable of operating even if our boss is absent.

06:13.720 --> 06:16.100
Armory, Team Yellow! Are you alive?!

06:16.100 --> 06:18.350
East Gate, Team Blue! Come in!

06:19.060 --> 06:21.860
We overheard that you're injured.

06:21.860 --> 06:24.570
Please watch over us from there.

06:27.440 --> 06:28.400
Alex!

06:28.400 --> 06:28.860
Ma'am!

06:30.070 --> 06:31.660
Bring the communications equipment!

06:33.240 --> 06:34.540
Win no matter what!

06:36.000 --> 06:37.790
Of course we will!

06:38.330 --> 06:40.460
Right. Let's go, Lieutenant.

06:40.460 --> 06:43.840
Hey! Both of you are hurt!

06:43.840 --> 06:46.670
I'll burn his philosopher's stone to a crisp.

06:47.340 --> 06:49.880
But in order for me to do that, I'll need the lieutenant's help.

06:51.720 --> 06:53.300
Who cares, let's get a move on.

06:55.600 --> 06:58.350
My duty is to protect the young master.

07:03.770 --> 07:04.770
Please take care of Izumi...

07:05.520 --> 07:06.650
...and everyone else.

07:09.650 --> 07:14.160
Let's rock 'n' roll!!

07:36.310 --> 07:38.270
So this is where he bit the dust.

07:39.600 --> 07:40.890
Did you do this?

07:41.440 --> 07:45.730
He was heavily injured by the time he got here.

07:45.730 --> 07:48.400
If that hadn't been the case, I'm not sure whether I would have made it out alive.

07:49.740 --> 07:55.780
Captain Buccaneer dealt a fatal blow to Bradley with the aid of a man from Xing...

08:02.370 --> 08:03.790
So, Bradley...

08:04.710 --> 08:06.790
...wouldn't you say my men were quite something?

08:33.320 --> 08:36.490
Shao May, you're all right...

08:36.490 --> 08:37.780
Thank goodness...

08:44.870 --> 08:46.040
Sir Alphonse?!

08:51.840 --> 08:53.050
May...

08:53.050 --> 08:56.010
I'm glad you're alive...

08:56.220 --> 08:58.300
Sir Alphonse, your body...!

09:03.980 --> 09:05.560
Sir Alphonse!

09:08.270 --> 09:11.400
Oh no! If you hadn't protected me...!

09:11.940 --> 09:13.690
Sir Alphonse!

09:13.690 --> 09:15.450
Sir Alphonse!!

09:33.920 --> 09:35.050
Master!

09:35.300 --> 09:37.510
Master! Master!!

09:38.510 --> 09:39.720
I'm still alive...

09:41.390 --> 09:45.560
Mr. Hohenheim protected us...

09:50.560 --> 09:53.110
H-Hohenheim!

09:55.110 --> 09:57.150
Hey! Hang in there!

10:11.130 --> 10:12.340
Hohenheim!!

10:12.500 --> 10:14.300
Two to start with.

10:19.050 --> 10:20.220
Stop it!!

10:29.480 --> 10:31.900
Our target is a man with long, blonde hair!

10:31.900 --> 10:34.360
Don't confuse him with the Fullmetal Alchemist!

10:34.360 --> 10:35.030
Roger!

10:35.860 --> 10:37.280
East Gate, Team Blue! Step on it!

10:37.780 --> 10:40.610
West Gate, Team White! Get in the shadows of the west building of headquarters!

10:40.610 --> 10:41.660
Yes, sir!

10:42.870 --> 10:43.910
Master!

10:53.380 --> 10:54.290
Fire!!

11:06.010 --> 11:08.350
Yo, Fullmetal! You alive?

11:08.810 --> 11:10.980
Attacks like these won't even scratch him!

11:11.900 --> 11:12.810
You're kidding me!

11:18.610 --> 11:20.610
Don't give him a chance to counterattack!

11:21.240 --> 11:22.240
Aye, sir!

11:32.710 --> 11:35.790
Dammit! He looks like he's enjoying the breeze!

11:35.790 --> 11:37.210
Roger that!

11:37.210 --> 11:38.170
Put me through to each squadron.

11:39.800 --> 11:41.050
Is that so?!

11:41.050 --> 11:43.180
Cease fire! Duck!

12:14.880 --> 12:16.080
Did I hit him?

12:16.080 --> 12:17.960
Grazed him.

12:17.960 --> 12:19.500
Fix your aim towards 12 o'clock.

12:20.960 --> 12:22.970
I can't see, so I don't know how much I should suppress my flames.

12:23.550 --> 12:25.760
Don't suppress them at all!

12:25.760 --> 12:26.800
Distance 50...

12:26.800 --> 12:28.140
No, 53!

12:28.680 --> 12:31.730
I still can't get used to this clapping business.

12:38.820 --> 12:40.690
A frontal attack!

12:44.150 --> 12:45.240
Nice work!

12:45.660 --> 12:47.950
Take that back. It's pretty useful.

12:48.410 --> 12:49.740
Fire! Fire!

12:49.740 --> 12:50.910
Keep it up!

12:51.700 --> 12:54.460
Don't give him the chance to counterattack!

12:54.460 --> 12:57.170
Keep making him use up his philosopher's stone!

13:22.690 --> 13:23.990
Incredible!

13:23.990 --> 13:28.200
I could make the world mine if I had that power!

13:28.200 --> 13:29.870
Hey, Greed!

13:30.450 --> 13:34.620
Is this what you meant by "making the world yours"?

13:35.000 --> 13:36.160
That's right!

13:36.160 --> 13:39.880
If I could just obtain that, the entire world would be mine!

13:40.420 --> 13:44.010
This feeling of emptiness inside me might just be cured!

13:44.300 --> 13:48.640
The thirst that's been haunting me since birth just might be quenched!

13:49.090 --> 13:50.720
You're disgraceful, Greed.

13:51.220 --> 13:53.270
That's not what you really want.

13:55.430 --> 13:57.600
Keep your mouth shut, shitty brat!

13:58.400 --> 14:00.690
I'm Greed, the avaricious!

14:00.690 --> 14:03.190
I'll obtain everything I want at any cost!

14:07.570 --> 14:08.990
Homunculus Cake, anyone?

14:21.750 --> 14:23.500
Not even a scratch...

14:24.880 --> 14:27.510
We need to do something about that barrier!

14:27.970 --> 14:30.010
We're running out of ammo! Bring us some more!

14:30.260 --> 14:31.760
Futile acts.

14:32.510 --> 14:36.020
Mere humans can hardly lay a finger on me.

14:39.020 --> 14:42.360
If humans can't, what about a homunculus?!

14:46.860 --> 14:49.280
Great timing, Greed.

14:49.280 --> 14:51.740
You're such a good son.

14:51.740 --> 14:55.200
I was just in need of a philosopher's stone.

14:56.240 --> 14:57.870
I'll be taking yours.

15:09.510 --> 15:10.590
Just kidding.

15:11.590 --> 15:15.310
You can't take my philosopher's stone without putting your barrier down, right?

15:15.310 --> 15:20.810
Did you not consider the possibility that you'd have the power of God taken from you instead?

15:22.980 --> 15:25.650
I'll take all of it!

15:32.280 --> 15:33.870
Greed!

16:00.520 --> 16:02.310
Don't give up!

16:14.780 --> 16:17.490
He... blocked it himself.

16:22.540 --> 16:24.000
He's at his limit!

16:28.000 --> 16:32.260
He can no longer hold down God!

17:10.500 --> 17:11.760
Stone...!

17:11.760 --> 17:12.880
Stone!

17:13.510 --> 17:15.340
Philosopher's stone!

17:29.610 --> 17:31.360
Run, Edward!

17:31.820 --> 17:33.860
Brother, run!

17:33.860 --> 17:35.450
Brother!!

17:38.700 --> 17:40.370
Stop it!

17:40.370 --> 17:41.740
Dammit!!

17:43.080 --> 17:44.040
Sir Al!

17:45.540 --> 17:46.620
Stop...!

17:46.620 --> 17:47.830
Stop it!

17:48.580 --> 17:50.040
Help...

17:50.040 --> 17:51.250
Help him...!

17:51.250 --> 17:53.050
Help my-

18:05.100 --> 18:07.440
May, I need you to do me a favor.

18:08.480 --> 18:13.070
Brother got my soul back by sacrificing his right arm.

18:14.230 --> 18:17.240
In that case, it should be possible to do the opposite.

18:18.910 --> 18:20.740
Sir Alphonse...?

18:22.240 --> 18:23.990
All I need you to do is to make a path.

18:24.580 --> 18:26.000
You can do it, right?

18:26.000 --> 18:28.370
But if I did that, you'd...!

18:28.370 --> 18:29.920
We're running out of time!

18:29.920 --> 18:30.750
Please.

18:32.250 --> 18:35.380
You're the only one I can ask to do something like this.

18:43.140 --> 18:44.260
Stone...

18:44.390 --> 18:46.180
Human...

18:46.600 --> 18:48.020
Energy...!

18:48.020 --> 18:49.270
Edward!!

18:49.270 --> 18:51.940
Give it to me!!

19:06.200 --> 19:07.700
What are you trying to do...?

19:09.000 --> 19:10.500
Cut it out...

19:10.500 --> 19:11.420
Hey...

19:11.830 --> 19:12.790
Al!

19:14.790 --> 19:16.920
Win this, Brother.

19:17.670 --> 19:20.800
Don't do it!!!

19:37.150 --> 19:39.240
Was that enough for you?

19:39.490 --> 19:40.320
Yeah.

19:40.860 --> 19:42.740
All that's left for me to do now is to believe in him.

20:13.850 --> 20:16.860
Yo. Looks like you got your soul back.

20:18.070 --> 20:20.860
Think he'll come here to bring you back?

20:22.070 --> 20:24.110
He will. I know he will.

20:30.540 --> 20:33.580
I'm curious to see what he'll sacrifice to do so.

20:45.140 --> 20:48.010
You idiot!!

21:16.920 --> 21:17.920
It's working.

21:18.590 --> 21:20.840
He... He has a chance!

21:20.840 --> 21:21.500
Keep it up!

21:21.500 --> 21:22.710
Kiddo!!

21:22.710 --> 21:23.970
That's the spirit!

21:23.970 --> 21:25.380
Get him, kid!

21:25.380 --> 21:26.470
Rush in!

21:26.630 --> 21:27.840
Edward!

21:27.840 --> 21:28.390
Ed!

21:28.390 --> 21:30.220
Edward Elric!

21:30.220 --> 21:34.270
Go!!

21:37.270 --> 21:38.230
Greed.

21:39.440 --> 21:41.400
Isn't this...

21:42.480 --> 21:43.650
...what you've always wanted more than anything?

21:44.190 --> 21:45.400
Mr. Edward!

21:45.570 --> 21:46.650
Edward!

21:46.990 --> 21:47.660
Go!

21:48.360 --> 21:49.410
Fullmetal!

21:51.280 --> 21:53.160
Yeah, you're right on target.

21:54.410 --> 21:56.620
What I've always wanted...

22:01.540 --> 22:04.510
...are friends like these.

22:18.730 --> 22:20.560
Get up, punk!

22:22.320 --> 22:27.070
I'll show you the difference between us!

22:38.250 --> 22:41.800
Ever since that day passed,

22:38.250 --> 22:41.800
Ano hi kara zutto

22:41.800 --> 22:46.050
I promised myself that I'd never cry.

22:41.800 --> 22:46.050
Nakanaito kimetekitakedo

22:46.590 --> 22:51.600
But even while I hoarded up the pain,

22:46.590 --> 22:51.600
Itami wo kasanetemo

22:51.600 --> 22:56.710
there was something I couldn't forgive myself for.

22:51.600 --> 22:56.710
Nanika wo yurusezu ni ita

22:58.190 --> 23:00.150
I'll never be able

22:58.190 --> 23:00.150
Mou modorenai

23:00.150 --> 23:02.650
to return to those days.

23:00.150 --> 23:02.650
Ikutsumo no hibi

23:02.650 --> 23:07.740
I'm still powerless.

23:02.650 --> 23:07.740
Boku wa mada nanimo dekizuni

23:07.740 --> 23:12.990
I watch as the shards of memories disappear, one by one;

23:07.740 --> 23:12.990
Kimi no ita kioku no kakera

23:12.990 --> 23:18.860
memories of when you were still with me.

23:12.990 --> 23:18.860
Mata hitotsu kieteyuku

23:19.540 --> 23:21.880
I long to become

23:19.540 --> 23:21.880
Kyou yori motto

23:21.880 --> 23:24.630
stronger than I am now,

23:21.880 --> 23:24.630
Tsuyoku naritai

23:24.630 --> 23:29.770
so that my voice will eventually reach you.

23:24.630 --> 23:29.770
Kono koe ga itsuka todokuyouni

23:29.770 --> 23:32.140
If the wind happens to stop

23:29.770 --> 23:32.140
Arukitsuzukete

23:32.140 --> 23:34.850
in the midst of my long journey,

23:32.140 --> 23:34.850
Kaze ga yandara

23:34.850 --> 23:39.560
I'll look up at the sky in search of you.

23:34.850 --> 23:39.560
Kimi wo sagashite sora miageruyo

23:40.310 --> 23:46.900
Beyond the daybreak, a ray of light breaks free.

23:40.310 --> 23:46.900
Yoake no saki ni hikari ga sasuyo

23:48.070 --> 23:52.450
A rainbow spans across the sky.

23:48.070 --> 23:52.450
Niji ga kakaruyo

24:00.120 --> 24:04.790
His power could bring anything about.

24:04.790 --> 24:07.250
However, he does not hesitate.

24:07.250 --> 24:10.090
Not when it is to protect the ones he loves.

24:11.220 --> 24:15.350
Next time, Fullmetal Alchemist:

24:15.350 --> 24:19.870
Episode 63, The Other Side of the Gateway.

24:15.370 --> 24:19.870
 The Other Side 
of the Gateway

24:20.690 --> 24:25.400
He fades away after overseeing all.
